error[RB0119]: `Unanswered` cannot be declared: every call can fail with it, besides its declared errors
 --> RB0119-unanswered-misused.road:6:16
  |
6 |   call ask() ! Unanswered
  |                ^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: `Unanswered` is the error a call fails with when it is not answered; it is handled only in the `fail Unanswered` (or `fail *`) outcome of an `invoke x.call(…)`

error[RB0119]: `Unanswered` is not a value a chart can make: a call fails with it only when it is not answered
